---
description: Zasady architektoniczne i projektowe TourERP
globs: **/*.php, **/*.blade.php
---

# TourERP Architecture Rules

- Always use strict types: `declare(strict_types=1);`
- Use Laravel 11 conventions and Filament v4 components.
- Never write business/calculation logic inside Blade views or Livewire components. Put them inside `App\Actions` or `App\Services`.
- Financial computations must always use integer cents or `bcmath` / `Decimal` to avoid floating-point inaccuracies.
- Ensure all Filament tables have proper eager loading (`modifyQueryUsing(fn ($query) => $query->with([...]))`) to prevent N+1 issues.
- Modal-First UI: Always prefer sliders/modals (`ModalSlideOver`) for sub-forms instead of redirecting to new pages.
